error[SCXML065]: `<assign type="addattribute">` names no attribute: `attr` is missing
 --> tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml:8:44
  |
8 |       <assign location="$cart/items" type="addattribute" expr="'x'"/>
  |                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^ adds an attribute
  |
  = note: `type="addattribute"` adds an attribute to the selected element, so `attr` must name it; the value comes from `expr` or the child content
  = help: add `attr="name"` with the attribute to add
  = spec: SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.6 <assign>
help: add the `attr` to set
