error[SCXML065]: `attr` on `<assign>` is used only with `type="addattribute"`
 --> tests/ui/scxml065-assign-forms.scxml:9:38
  |
9 |       <assign location="$cart/items" attr="count" expr="1"/>
  |                                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^ attribute name without `addattribute`
  |
  = note: only `type="addattribute"` adds an attribute named by `attr`; every other placement replaces or inserts nodes, so `attr` would be ignored
  = help: remove `attr`, or set `type="addattribute"` to add that attribute
  = spec: SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.6 <assign>
help: remove `attr`
  |
9 -       <assign location="$cart/items" attr="count" expr="1"/>
9 +       <assign location="$cart/items" expr="1"/>

